{"id":"tochka","lemma":"точка","pos":"noun","rank":1359,"glosses":["period, dot, full stop","point","dot, (for Morse code; colloquially dit)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"точки","plural":"точки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это зависит от вашей точки зрения.","en":"It depends on your point of view.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to depend , to rely","l":"зависеть"},{"g":"from"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,{"g":"sight, vision","l":"зрение"}]},{"text":"Я не могу принять вашей точки зрения.","en":"I can't adopt your view.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,{"g":"sight, vision","l":"зрение"}]},{"text":"Чем ваша точка зрения отличается от его?","en":"How does your opinion differ from his?","words":[{"g":"than"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,{"g":"sight, vision","l":"зрение"},null,{"g":"from"},{"g":"him / his"}]},{"text":"Давайте найдём точки соприкосновения.","en":"Let's find common ground.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},null,null]},{"text":"Это обоснованная точка зрения.","en":"This is a valid point of view.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,{"g":"sight, vision","l":"зрение"}]}]}